      "cooked": "<p>hi I just got this game, and I am trying to learn it. &nbsp;so ihave a qweastion. how do the ellemental effect attack &nbsp;work. say I deal one of the villians say fire effect. will this mean he or she will be dealt fire attack evveryvturn as if he or she is on fire or does this just mean that if they arecweek to that ellement they get delt more damage, or they just get attacked regukarly .</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
