      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/pwatson1974/{size}/1925_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-12T22:42:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Geenrally the damage types are themeatic. There are some villains that are immune to various attqcks, such as Voss' minions and some that have retaliatory effect,s such as Baron Blade's elemental redistributor but unless one of those effects is in play, damage dealt is just damage dealt.</p>",
